DESCRIPTION
===========

Roboflow is a universal, schema-driven runtime decoding engine for robotics data. It provides
high-performance conversion between different robotics message formats (CDR, Protobuf, JSON)
and storage formats (MCAP, ROS1 bag).

PROJECT STRUCTURE
=================

- roboflow/  - Main pipeline crate with processing engine
- robocodec/ - I/O format handling and codec support

